OL,3,GNEWSAPeriod kits given to students for
OL,4,Asport away games
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeriod kits are being provided to
OL,7,Fstudent athletes at a university to
OL,8,F"reduce anxiety and stress" around
OL,9,Fmenstruating during sport.
OL,11,FTeesside University is giving the kits
OL,12,Fto its sport clubs to take on away
OL,13,Ffixtures as part of its Period Dignity
OL,14,Fcampaign, which aims to help women feel
OL,15,Fcomfortable enough to keep
OL,16,Fparticipating.
OL,18,FVolleyball team captain Samantha Soto
OL,19,FPupillo, a second year law student,
OL,20,Fsaid the kits would provide "extra
OL,21,Freassurance" and "means students can
OL,22,Ffocus on taking part".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
